WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:14.040
Stop it, Joe!
Look at this !

2
00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.120
- Shall we go for a walk?
- OK.

3
00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:20.040
Come on man, here we go!

4
00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:41.440
I will show them
what I can do...

5
00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:01.080
Road under construction

6
00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:52.080
THE CARNIVAL OF SOULS

7
00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:20.280
The river carries
so much mud and sand

8
00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:23.440
that we will have trouble
to find the car.

9
00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:35.440
- This way.
- Good.

10
00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:39.600
- What happened ?
- We can't help it, sir.

11
00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:42.800
- Oh no ?
- We were already on deck,

12
00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:45.240
when the car
came behind us.

13
00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:50.080
She wanted to double us
and she had to swerve.

14
00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:52.680
You wouldn't have it
a bit pushed?

15
00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:05.280
It's been three hours.

16
00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:08.280
Oh yes ? It's not sure
let's find her.

17
00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:11.440
There is too much current
and too much sand.

18
00:04:12.040 --> 00:04:13.960
We can always try...

19
00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:21.040
What's going on ?

20
00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:43.880
Come on, let's go down!

21
00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:08.040
- So that ! It's Mary Henry...
- How are you ?

22
00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:10.520
How did you get out of there?

23
00:05:10.920 --> 00:05:14.040
Put that,
we'll take you back to town.

24
00:05:17.400 --> 00:05:19.240
And the other girls?

25
00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:24.480
I do not remember.

26
00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:02.000
It will be the same organ
in Utah?

27
00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:06.400
Practically. It's me
who installed it there.

28
00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:09.080
The crash won't delay
your leaving ?

29
00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:13.320
No, I'm leaving this morning.
Nothing keeps me here.

30
00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:14.840
It's true.

31
00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:18.120
Alright Mary. This church is going to have
an excellent organist!

32
00:08:18.440 --> 00:08:22.080
- You'll like it.
- This job or another...

33
00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:26.240
You are going to work
in a church, anyway...

34
00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:28.720
To hold the organ, that's all.

35
00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:31.040
Let's go!

36
00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:35.560
It's not very well paid,
sure, but it's a start.

37
00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:38.680
Are you going to your parents?

38
00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:42.080
No, I'm in a hurry.

39
00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:45.680
I will not have time
to stop on the way.

40
00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:50.320
Mary, music, we don't do it
only with his head.

41
00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:53.880
Put a little of your soul into it,
Okay ?

42
00:09:01.080 --> 00:09:03.040
Good luck, Mary!

43
00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:05.600
Come see us sometime.

44
00:09:05.920 --> 00:09:09.120
Thanks, but I'm leaving
for all time.

45
00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:11.600
- Can I help you ?
- Full.

46
00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:13.080
OK.

47
00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:40.680
Would you like anything else, ma'am?

48
00:13:41.280 --> 00:13:45.120
What is this big building
a few miles near the lake?

49
00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:48.040
Ah, you want to talk
of the old public bath.

50
00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:51.280
It used to be a nice luxurious place.

51
00:13:51.480 --> 00:13:54.760
The lake has dried up
and they turned it into a ballroom.

52
00:13:54.920 --> 00:13:57.160
And then they built
these buildings

53
00:13:57.280 --> 00:13:59.760
and for a time they performed there
a kind of carnival.

54
00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:03.440
But, that was years ago.
Now there is nothing.

55
00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:05.160
I see.

56
00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:13.280
I have the address of a pension,
could you tell me how to get there?

57
00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:17.000
Sure. It's very close to here.

58
00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:28.280
I reserved it for you
as soon as I got your letter.

59
00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:33.440
I could have rented it yesterday...

60
00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:37.560
It is very good,
thats what i was looking for.

61
00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:40.040
I was sure of it.

62
00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:43.040
It is not really
a boarding house here.

63
00:14:43.360 --> 00:14:47.440
It's just you and Mr. Linden,
across the hall.

64
00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:56.600
You each have
your bathroom.

65
00:14:59.600 --> 00:15:01.520
And for the baths,

66
00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:04.480
take as many
that you want.

67
00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:07.240
Thanks. I will like it here.

68
00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:10.000
I hope you will stay
one moment.

69
00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:14.200
I live on the ground floor,
ON the other side.

70
00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:18.400
If you are missing something,
it will wait until tomorrow.

71
00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:25.800
- Good night.
- Good night, Mrs. Thomas.

72
00:16:22.760 --> 00:16:26.480
And here is our little gem,
MissHenry.

73
00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.480
We come from the same city,
he and I.

74
00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:32.840
I say. It is over there
that we have been told about you.

75
00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:35.280
Have you found accommodation?

76
00:16:35.520 --> 00:16:37.760
- Yes, I took a room.
- Good.

77
00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:40.520
I hope that
you will like it here.

78
00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:43.760
Of course the church
is not big

79
00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:47.080
but our parishioners
are charming.

80
00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:50.600
We're gonna throw a little party
in your honor.

81
00:16:51.080 --> 00:16:54.080
- I'd rather not.
- Oh good ?

82
00:16:54.520 --> 00:16:57.320
Of course it's not
an obligation,

83
00:16:57.760 --> 00:17:00.360
but these ladies will be disappointed.

84
00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:03.760
The important thing is that they like
my way of playing!

85
00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:06.520
Definitely...

86
00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:09.840
Let's stop talking about it.
We'll see later.

87
00:17:10.280 --> 00:17:12.480
But my dear,

88
00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:16.880
you can not
live like a hermit!

89
00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:20.920
- Can I try it?
- I was going to ask you.

90
00:17:42.480 --> 00:17:43.360
I leave you.

91
00:17:44.280 --> 00:17:47.040
I'm right next to it
If you need me.

92
00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:06.800
We have an organist
who knows how to touch souls.

93
00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:06.960
- What did you see ?
- Nothing.

94
00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:10.520
I played too long.
I feel weird.

95
00:19:10.640 --> 00:19:12.120
You need air.

96
00:19:12.800 --> 00:19:16.880
I have a visit to make,
near the lake. I am taking you ?

97
00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:19.800
Near the old pavilion?

98
00:19:20.880 --> 00:19:22.720
- Are you going there?
- Very close.

99
00:19:23.080 --> 00:19:25.880
- Do you want to see it?
- With you, yes!

100
00:19:26.120 --> 00:19:27.520
Good.

101
00:20:03.480 --> 00:20:05.040
It was great before.

102
00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:07.760
It's been closed for a long time.

103
00:20:08.160 --> 00:20:10.760
- Can we come in?
- Certainly not !

104
00:20:11.120 --> 00:20:15.080
It's dangerous, that's why
they put up a fence.

105
00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:18.000
We could sneak...

106
00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:22.200
What attracts you so much?

107
00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:23.560
I do not know.

108
00:20:24.120 --> 00:20:26.640
I'm pretty reasonable
usually.

109
00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:31.920
I may want to see
if he is hiding something.

110
00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:34.680
- Are you coming with me?
- Nope.

111
00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:36.920
It is prohibited by law.

112
00:20:37.240 --> 00:20:40.680
A pastor cannot
break the law !

113
00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:44.760
It's true. I'll be back
maybe another time.

114
00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:48.720
We're leaving ?

115
00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:18.320
- Oh, it's you!
- Good evening.

116
00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:22.680
You played the organ
all day ?

117
00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:26.800
I took a drive
with my boss.

118
00:21:27.280 --> 00:21:29.080
An old pastor.

119
00:21:31.520 --> 00:21:34.000
You have some
pay you a portion.

120
00:21:35.320 --> 00:21:38.480
as Mr. Linden would say,
the other tenant.

121
00:21:39.160 --> 00:21:42.880
- Have you had dinner?
- I forgot !

122
00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:46.200
It's not a boarding house
but what do i have

123
00:21:46.640 --> 00:21:48.880
make you a coffee
and a sandwich.

124
00:21:49.040 --> 00:21:51.440
I show you this
in a moment.

125
00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:55.120
Good. I will have a bath,
as you suggested.

126
00:21:55.320 --> 00:22:00.280
As much as you want,
this is not a problem.

127
00:22:47.440 --> 00:22:49.040
Come in, Mrs. Thomas.

128
00:22:50.920 --> 00:22:52.920
One minute.

129
00:23:13.600 --> 00:23:15.840
I thought
it was Madame Thomas!

130
00:23:16.160 --> 00:23:18.880
I suspected a little...

131
00:23:19.200 --> 00:23:21.400
I am John Linden,
your neighbour.

132
00:23:21.720 --> 00:23:24.360
- Nice to meet you. Excuse me.
- Say...

133
00:23:24.640 --> 00:23:27.600
One moment, stay out!

134
00:23:53.840 --> 00:23:56.200
My name is Mary Henry.

135
00:23:56.320 --> 00:23:58.920
I say...

136
00:23:59.240 --> 00:24:02.200
I heard you say to Mrs. Thomas
that you had not had dinner.

137
00:24:02.520 --> 00:24:04.840
Since we are neighbors...

138
00:24:05.160 --> 00:24:06.800
I haven't eaten either.

139
00:24:07.120 --> 00:24:09.360
so I invite you to dinner?

140
00:24:09.680 --> 00:24:11.600
That's nice, but no thanks.

141
00:24:11.920 --> 00:24:14.040
I know we don't know each other...

142
00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:16.800
I'm sorry, I can't.

143
00:24:17.120 --> 00:24:21.080
There is a small restaurant
very nice, close...

144
00:24:21.600 --> 00:24:24.200
And I don't like
eat alone!

145
00:24:24.520 --> 00:24:26.920
I dine in my room,
tonight.

146
00:24:27.880 --> 00:24:31.280
Good. If you change your mind,
call me !

147
00:24:34.800 --> 00:24:36.680
We feel lonely here sometimes.

148
00:24:37.320 --> 00:24:39.280
Good night, Mr. Linden.

149
00:26:02.160 --> 00:26:05.720
Miss Henry?
It's Mrs. Thomas.

150
00:26:24.760 --> 00:26:26.760
Who is that man
in the corridor ?

151
00:26:28.720 --> 00:26:30.240
A man ?

152
00:26:32.520 --> 00:26:34.520
You must have seen Mr. Linden.

153
00:26:34.720 --> 00:26:37.160
He has his room opposite.

154
00:26:37.400 --> 00:26:40.560
No, the other!

155
00:26:41.080 --> 00:26:43.720
There is no one else!

156
00:26:44.560 --> 00:26:47.240
There's me, you and Mr. Linden.

157
00:26:47.520 --> 00:26:49.880
The three of us, that's all.

158
00:26:50.120 --> 00:26:52.600
But you must have seen it,
out !

159
00:26:53.360 --> 00:26:55.640
You have to eat.

160
00:26:56.040 --> 00:26:59.760
When you have an empty stomach,
sometimes we have funny ideas.

161
00:27:00.120 --> 00:27:02.920
You must have heard
crack the floor.

162
00:27:03.240 --> 00:27:05.480
Old houses creak!

163
00:27:05.800 --> 00:27:09.520
I saw it, I tell you,
not heard !

164
00:27:12.400 --> 00:27:14.480
Do not tell
such things!

165
00:27:15.800 --> 00:27:18.200
Even without that,
I have trouble sleeping!

166
00:27:19.320 --> 00:27:21.760
It's these old houses...

167
00:27:22.080 --> 00:27:26.000
These are too big.
They have too many corners.

168
00:27:28.960 --> 00:27:32.080
You must not leave
roam his imagination.

169
00:27:32.400 --> 00:27:35.040
- You're going out ?
- Obviously !

170
00:27:55.840 --> 00:27:58.320
There is nobody.

171
00:28:00.480 --> 00:28:04.160
eat the sandwich
what I did to you.

172
00:28:05.960 --> 00:28:09.240
Leave the coffee,
if it keeps you awake.

173
00:28:09.600 --> 00:28:11.520
No risk.

174
00:28:14.320 --> 00:28:16.800
Coffee never keeps me awake.

175
00:29:39.040 --> 00:29:41.680
Good morning !

176
00:29:42.000 --> 00:29:43.800
I heard your alarm clock!

177
00:29:44.120 --> 00:29:46.320
- Guess what I have.
- No idea.

178
00:29:46.640 --> 00:29:49.440
What's needed
to start the day off right.

179
00:29:49.760 --> 00:29:53.000
I do it in my room
to drink it out of bed.

180
00:29:53.320 --> 00:29:56.200
But to come and see you,
I had to dress well!

181
00:29:56.680 --> 00:29:58.640
Exactly what I need!

182
00:29:58.960 --> 00:30:02.640
Two coffees, it works!

183
00:30:08.560 --> 00:30:12.200
You were less happy
from my visit last night...

184
00:30:12.600 --> 00:30:15.280
I am not someone
very sociable.

185
00:30:15.720 --> 00:30:19.400
You lead me into temptation!

186
00:30:19.880 --> 00:30:21.640
What ?
It's too complicated for me!

187
00:30:21.960 --> 00:30:24.640
I am not
than a mere storekeeper.

188
00:30:25.080 --> 00:30:27.560
But I make a good living.

189
00:30:28.200 --> 00:30:31.200
I have a small drop left.
You want some ?

190
00:30:31.520 --> 00:30:35.520
No thanks. It is not indicated
for an organist.

191
00:30:36.040 --> 00:30:37.480
Is that your job?

192
00:30:37.960 --> 00:30:40.120
We pay you
to play the organ?

193
00:30:40.720 --> 00:30:42.400
Some churches do.

194
00:30:43.320 --> 00:30:47.000
You are a churchwoman...
I couldn't know!

195
00:30:47.560 --> 00:30:50.000
This is where I earn my living,
that's all.

196
00:30:50.600 --> 00:30:53.360
- Funny way to see!
- Why ?

197
00:30:53.880 --> 00:30:56.800
What's shocking?
I work

198
00:30:57.000 --> 00:30:58.960
in a church, that's all.

199
00:30:59.440 --> 00:31:02.080
I am an organist
and I get paid to play.

200
00:31:03.480 --> 00:31:06.000
And it doesn't give you
nightmares ?

201
00:31:07.960 --> 00:31:10.000
It's funny
you say that.

202
00:31:10.720 --> 00:31:13.520
In fact,
it has nothing to do with it, but...

203
00:31:13.840 --> 00:31:17.400
Last night,
I had a weird feeling.

204
00:31:17.920 --> 00:31:20.800
I too had
a difficult night.

205
00:31:22.000 --> 00:31:23.120
It's strange...

206
00:31:24.280 --> 00:31:26.960
Everything is different
during the day.

207
00:31:27.960 --> 00:31:31.320
At night, our imagination
plays tricks on us.

208
00:31:32.520 --> 00:31:35.600
And as soon as it's day,
everything is in order.

209
00:31:38.000 --> 00:31:39.760
Nights should be removed.

210
00:31:40.280 --> 00:31:43.840
Or return them
more interesting?

211
00:31:46.880 --> 00:31:50.320
- Where did you learn the organ?
- At University.

212
00:31:50.560 --> 00:31:52.520
I could have gone there!

213
00:31:53.240 --> 00:31:57.520
But I preferred football.
All these courses to learn...

214
00:31:57.800 --> 00:32:01.560
- Eh yes !
- I'm not stupid,

215
00:32:02.280 --> 00:32:05.400
but I didn't like
the methods of the time.

216
00:32:05.960 --> 00:32:08.720
I hated
raw materials.

217
00:32:09.320 --> 00:32:11.800
- Like what ?
- You know...

218
00:32:12.320 --> 00:32:14.920
Like raw materials
from Brazil.

219
00:32:18.280 --> 00:32:21.160
coffee, sugar,
stuff like that!

220
00:32:22.000 --> 00:32:25.920
I didn't care about school,
I preferred girls.

221
00:32:26.520 --> 00:32:28.680
Was it your favorite subject?

222
00:32:29.320 --> 00:32:31.640
Yes, the only one where
I passed my exams.

223
00:32:33.480 --> 00:32:35.920
A problem ?
Does it still taste like coffee?

224
00:32:36.840 --> 00:32:39.280
don't take me
for an alcoholic!

225
00:32:39.520 --> 00:32:42.320
It's to be happy
in the morning, that's all.

226
00:32:42.520 --> 00:32:44.480
At noon,
you must be hilarious!

227
00:32:44.800 --> 00:32:47.040
That's why I'm appreciated.

228
00:32:47.360 --> 00:32:49.640
I work
in good spirits.

229
00:32:49.960 --> 00:32:52.880
I didn't make you laugh
this morning ?

230
00:32:53.200 --> 00:32:55.680
Yes, this morning
you have fulfilled me.

231
00:32:56.000 --> 00:32:59.040
I can fill you too
in the evening if you want.

232
00:33:00.520 --> 00:33:02.840
- I'll rinse the cups.
- Nope !

233
00:33:03.160 --> 00:33:05.600
Especially not,
it would be less good tomorrow!

234
00:33:05.920 --> 00:33:07.280
Thanks for the coffee.

235
00:33:08.120 --> 00:33:09.920
Unhygienic but delicious.

236
00:33:10.040 --> 00:33:14.320
You should have put
some disinfectant!

237
00:33:15.720 --> 00:33:18.200
We really need
am I leaving already?

238
00:33:18.760 --> 00:33:20.000
You will arrive
to walk through the door?

239
00:33:21.440 --> 00:33:23.400
Who do you take me for?

240
00:33:23.520 --> 00:33:26.480
I just want to say
that you are well charged.

241
00:33:28.080 --> 00:33:30.080
Let's stay there...

242
00:33:30.400 --> 00:33:33.760
You must probably
go to work Mr. Linden, right?

243
00:33:34.120 --> 00:33:37.800
- Not you ?
- No, shopping day.

244
00:33:50.120 --> 00:33:51.880
Does the hem hang well?

245
00:33:52.200 --> 00:33:54.160
We're going to do a little editing.

246
00:33:54.480 --> 00:33:57.920
Aside from that,
the drape is perfect.

247
00:33:58.240 --> 00:34:02.160
This is not reasonnable,
but I'll take both.

248
00:34:02.480 --> 00:34:05.640
We're going to edit a little
the rounding here.

249
00:34:06.480 --> 00:34:08.920
I accompany you
to your cabin?

250
00:35:30.080 --> 00:35:30.800
I love it !

251
00:35:31.120 --> 00:35:33.880
Can you have it delivered to me?

252
00:35:35.360 --> 00:35:37.800
I said I took it!

253
00:35:53.200 --> 00:35:55.240
But what does she have?

254
00:35:58.520 --> 00:36:00.800
What do they all have?

255
00:36:04.040 --> 00:36:06.120
Why am I not being answered?

256
00:37:48.320 --> 00:37:50.560
- What is it ?
- It's that man!

257
00:37:52.040 --> 00:37:55.160
I meant him no harm.
I was thirsty.

258
00:37:55.560 --> 00:38:00.160
No, not that man!

259
00:38:02.000 --> 00:38:03.880
It was the other!

260
00:38:05.840 --> 00:38:09.160
There was someone else
a strange man.

261
00:38:09.640 --> 00:38:11.320
You were scared, that's all.

262
00:38:11.720 --> 00:38:14.840
nervous breakdowns,
It's no use. Calm down!

263
00:38:15.280 --> 00:38:20.080
The am Dr. Samuels.
My office is just across the street.

264
00:38:20.840 --> 00:38:22.760
You are in shock.

265
00:38:23.320 --> 00:38:25.440
Can I help you
if you desire it.

266
00:38:26.120 --> 00:38:28.520
Thanks. I can come
right away ?

267
00:38:28.720 --> 00:38:31.200
Sure.
I take him to my office.

268
00:38:31.640 --> 00:38:33.720
I will take care of her.

269
00:38:48.360 --> 00:38:51.920
I heard nothing more,
but that wasn't the worst.

270
00:38:52.760 --> 00:38:55.080
Nobody saw me.

271
00:38:55.400 --> 00:38:56.840
It was like...

272
00:38:58.960 --> 00:39:01.480
As if
I had ceased to exist,

273
00:39:03.320 --> 00:39:06.000
and that I didn't have
no place in this world,

274
00:39:07.000 --> 00:39:09.200
no life around me.

275
00:39:10.360 --> 00:39:14.160
That's where you saw
that man ?

276
00:39:14.880 --> 00:39:16.120
Yes.

277
00:39:18.720 --> 00:39:22.320
Excuse me for having my back
turned, I took notes.

278
00:39:22.640 --> 00:39:24.720
I must have spoken for an hour.

279
00:39:25.040 --> 00:39:28.200
Did you tell me everything?
Did you forget anything?

280
00:39:28.960 --> 00:39:32.120
No, I told you
all the story.

281
00:39:32.440 --> 00:39:34.600
He follows me, that's all.

282
00:39:34.920 --> 00:39:38.760
- It is not so simple.
- What do you mean ?

283
00:39:39.360 --> 00:39:42.960
If he had been in the park,
someone would have seen him.

284
00:39:43.280 --> 00:39:46.640
And that man on the landing
that you are alone

285
00:39:46.960 --> 00:39:50.840
- to have seen.
- Where are you coming from?

286
00:39:51.160 --> 00:39:54.880
Your car fell
in the water a few days ago.

287
00:39:55.200 --> 00:39:57.480
You survived
by miracle.

288
00:39:57.800 --> 00:40:00.720
The emotional shock
must have been terrible.

289
00:40:01.160 --> 00:40:03.880
You take me for a fool
that's it ?

290
00:40:04.040 --> 00:40:06.160
No way.

291
00:40:06.480 --> 00:40:08.120
I'm a sensible person

292
00:40:08.440 --> 00:40:11.360
rational,
I don't imagine nonsense.

293
00:40:11.680 --> 00:40:15.880
Let's go! It may
happen to anyone!

294
00:40:16.360 --> 00:40:20.760
You have never interpreted
a crooked conversation?

295
00:40:22.120 --> 00:40:24.480
You never took
a person

296
00:40:24.640 --> 00:40:28.280
- for another?
- I do not see the link.

297
00:40:28.760 --> 00:40:32.240
Our imagination
plays tricks on us.

298
00:40:32.560 --> 00:40:35.960
She distorts what they say
our senses. OK ?

299
00:40:36.600 --> 00:40:38.160
It's possible.

300
00:40:38.480 --> 00:40:42.000
These are things
that happen every day.

301
00:40:42.320 --> 00:40:46.320
So during a high fever
or after a shock.

302
00:40:46.640 --> 00:40:50.080
I can not believe
that I imagined all this.

303
00:40:50.560 --> 00:40:54.160
This man makes you
think about someone ?

304
00:40:54.320 --> 00:40:56.680
- To a friend, to your father?
- Nope.

305
00:40:56.840 --> 00:41:00.320
- Do you have a boyfriend?
- No, I don't want to.

306
00:41:00.640 --> 00:41:03.120
- Never ?
- Nope.

307
00:41:04.640 --> 00:41:08.600
I find myself telling you this,
but it's true.

308
00:41:08.960 --> 00:41:12.240
I don't wanna feel
close to someone.

309
00:41:12.560 --> 00:41:15.040
You have always been
like that ?

310
00:41:16.840 --> 00:41:18.320
No I do not know.

311
00:41:18.640 --> 00:41:22.920
You don't like to mingle
to others, to their lives?

312
00:41:23.240 --> 00:41:26.240
I find it difficult to approach them.

313
00:41:26.560 --> 00:41:30.720
I feel like
I'm looking for something else.

314
00:41:30.880 --> 00:41:33.440
Do you feel guilty?

315
00:41:34.120 --> 00:41:35.920
I don't understand.

316
00:41:36.320 --> 00:41:39.840
I am not a psychiatrist
I may be clumsy.

317
00:41:40.200 --> 00:41:43.680
anything can come
of a feeling of guilt.

318
00:41:43.840 --> 00:41:45.720
It's ridiculous !

319
00:41:46.040 --> 00:41:48.800
It's possible.
Frankly I do not know.

320
00:41:50.160 --> 00:41:51.880
One thing is certain.

321
00:41:52.520 --> 00:41:56.160
If my imagination is in question,
I can put it in order.

322
00:41:56.840 --> 00:41:59.320
You are a very strong-willed person.

323
00:41:59.760 --> 00:42:01.400
I want to survive anyway.

324
00:42:02.520 --> 00:42:05.200
This old pavilion,
near the lake,

325
00:42:05.760 --> 00:42:08.040
is related to all this
according to you.

326
00:42:09.480 --> 00:42:13.200
I could go
to get to the bottom of it.

327
00:42:14.440 --> 00:42:17.080
- If I went...
- No rush !

328
00:42:17.960 --> 00:42:21.800
If it's my imagination
It has to stop.

329
00:42:22.280 --> 00:42:24.880
Get accompanied,
at least.

330
00:42:25.000 --> 00:42:27.800
You said that
I have the will!

331
00:42:28.840 --> 00:42:31.040
It is now
that I have to go.

332
00:42:31.520 --> 00:42:34.720
If necessary, I will go alone.

333
00:47:14.200 --> 00:47:18.120
I hope you're not going yet
send me for a ride,

334
00:47:19.040 --> 00:47:21.480
but I would like
invite you to dinner.

335
00:47:21.720 --> 00:47:25.560
I ate in town. And I must
rehearse in church tonight.

336
00:47:25.920 --> 00:47:30.240
If I came
take you out?

337
00:47:30.560 --> 00:47:33.120
We could go dancing
If you want.

338
00:47:33.440 --> 00:47:36.560
Dance,
it's not my forte.

339
00:47:40.920 --> 00:47:43.080
Can I ask you something?

340
00:47:43.400 --> 00:47:47.000
- Always ask.
- Are you afraid of men?

341
00:47:47.320 --> 00:47:49.840
No way.

342
00:47:51.680 --> 00:47:54.280
You are quite distant.

343
00:47:54.640 --> 00:47:57.880
You were nicer this morning
when we had coffee.

344
00:47:58.120 --> 00:48:00.760
I needed company.

345
00:48:01.280 --> 00:48:04.040
You may be
happy tonight.

346
00:48:04.920 --> 00:48:07.120
It's not funny
to go home alone.

347
00:48:09.920 --> 00:48:11.120
It's true.

348
00:48:12.160 --> 00:48:15.000
I will be finished around 9 o'clock,
will it be ok?

349
00:48:15.320 --> 00:48:17.520
Very well.

350
00:48:18.600 --> 00:48:22.240
See you at church.

351
00:51:47.680 --> 00:51:50.320
It is a profanation,
sacrilege!

352
00:51:50.720 --> 00:51:53.160
what are you playing there
in a church?

353
00:51:53.600 --> 00:51:57.160
So you have no respect?

354
00:51:58.920 --> 00:52:02.480
I pity you to miss
of soul at this point.

355
00:52:03.320 --> 00:52:05.840
This organ and the music
we play here

356
00:52:06.000 --> 00:52:09.120
have for us
great meaning.

357
00:52:09.600 --> 00:52:12.160
I thought it was
same for you.

358
00:52:12.680 --> 00:52:14.600
But if not,

359
00:52:15.000 --> 00:52:18.240
you can't stay
our organist.

360
00:52:18.800 --> 00:52:22.120
I must, in all conscience,
ask you to leave.

361
00:52:46.600 --> 00:52:48.840
I don't give up on you
however.

362
00:52:49.400 --> 00:52:51.320
Don't turn your back
to the Church!

363
00:52:51.560 --> 00:52:54.560
You will find help here,
accept it.

364
00:53:24.720 --> 00:53:27.720
Hi ! I wait
for a long time.

365
00:53:27.960 --> 00:53:29.760
My car is here, let's go.

366
00:53:56.600 --> 00:53:58.360
So what ? You don't drink?

367
00:53:58.720 --> 00:54:01.360
- Not really.
- Not really !

368
00:54:01.680 --> 00:54:04.920
What's left,
can you tell me?

369
00:54:05.760 --> 00:54:09.280
Me, I drink...

370
00:54:09.440 --> 00:54:11.760
Ah, really, I drink!

371
00:54:17.360 --> 00:54:19.480
You don't like either
the music ?

372
00:54:19.880 --> 00:54:22.040
- If it's okay.
- But no !

373
00:54:22.360 --> 00:54:24.120
You don't like dancing

374
00:54:24.440 --> 00:54:26.800
nor drink,

375
00:54:27.120 --> 00:54:30.080
nor that a man approaches you.
I am wrong ?

376
00:54:30.720 --> 00:54:34.440
- I did not say that.
- You do not pick up a word!

377
00:54:37.320 --> 00:54:40.680
I will put back
the song you love so much.

378
00:54:46.440 --> 00:54:50.320
- Hey Johnny, who's the girl?
- You don't know her, kid.

379
00:54:50.680 --> 00:54:53.000
You're hiding things from me.

380
00:54:53.400 --> 00:54:56.480
It's not the kind of sausage
that you usually go out!

381
00:54:56.800 --> 00:54:59.880
stop drooling,
she's too good for you!

382
00:55:00.320 --> 00:55:02.160
We bet ?

383
00:55:02.840 --> 00:55:06.960
Drop it.
I'm on a roll.

384
00:55:07.080 --> 00:55:08.520
I could help you...

385
00:55:08.840 --> 00:55:12.280
I don't want her to see me
with a sucker like you!

386
00:55:13.960 --> 00:55:15.920
Good luck !

387
00:55:19.520 --> 00:55:21.400
Have you met a friend?

388
00:55:21.720 --> 00:55:26.520
Yes... A classmate.

389
00:55:28.280 --> 00:55:31.800
He told me that a girl
wanted to talk to me.

390
00:55:33.160 --> 00:55:36.280
- He asked me to go.
- What did you answer?

391
00:55:36.720 --> 00:55:40.040
I refused, of course.
I'm going out with you tonight.

392
00:55:44.800 --> 00:55:48.800
He said you looked
to bore you with me.

393
00:55:49.360 --> 00:55:50.960
It's not true!

394
00:55:51.360 --> 00:55:54.360
I enjoyed this evening
in your company.

395
00:55:54.840 --> 00:55:57.360
She would have been sinister,
without you.

396
00:55:59.160 --> 00:56:01.880
So have fun!
Finish your drink!

397
00:56:08.240 --> 00:56:10.920
It's not poison
at whatever cost!

398
00:56:11.400 --> 00:56:14.040
I'm sorry
to be disagreeable to you.

399
00:56:15.480 --> 00:56:16.680
I do not understand anything.

400
00:56:17.520 --> 00:56:20.920
First, you're ignoring me.
Well, that's class!

401
00:56:21.360 --> 00:56:23.840
You have to be prayed for, what...

402
00:56:24.160 --> 00:56:27.120
And there you spin soft,
a real mess!

403
00:56:28.120 --> 00:56:32.920
Yesterday I was not interested.
Tonight I want to be with you.

404
00:56:33.640 --> 00:56:37.040
- With anyone ?
- No, with you!

405
00:56:43.480 --> 00:56:46.160
Come on, let yourself go...

406
00:56:49.240 --> 00:56:53.000
Do you prefer to be alone?
I'm leaving, if you want.

407
00:56:53.800 --> 00:56:56.120
I like your company,
I assure you !

408
00:56:57.440 --> 00:57:01.480
Don't leave me alone tonight.
I want to stay close to you.

409
00:57:10.120 --> 00:57:13.240
- It is serious ?
- Yes.

410
00:57:24.040 --> 00:57:26.000
If we were leaving,
both ?

411
00:57:26.880 --> 00:57:30.040
You know my room
is next to yours.

412
00:57:30.920 --> 00:57:33.760
So you don't have
just one word to say...

413
00:57:52.800 --> 00:57:56.760
- Oh dear !
- We're going to wake Mrs. Thomas!

414
00:57:57.080 --> 00:58:00.320
She sleeps on the other side,
she won't hear anything.

415
00:58:09.760 --> 00:58:11.720
Sweetheart...

416
00:58:12.880 --> 00:58:15.880
Won't you leave me there?

417
00:58:17.840 --> 00:58:20.280
It's dark in there

418
00:58:22.080 --> 00:58:24.000
Are you going to be alone tonight?

419
00:58:24.560 --> 00:58:27.880
Let me pass
a moment with you.

420
00:58:29.240 --> 00:58:31.120
You don't want to be alone!

421
00:58:31.440 --> 00:58:33.400
No.

422
00:58:44.080 --> 00:58:46.840
- Sorry, I can not...
- Lets go !

423
00:58:47.400 --> 00:58:51.200
I must please you a little
since you let me in.

424
00:59:20.240 --> 00:59:21.920
But what do you have ?

425
00:59:25.600 --> 00:59:27.520
What is happening here ?

426
00:59:28.960 --> 00:59:32.240
- What do you have ?
- A man is chasing me.

427
00:59:32.880 --> 00:59:34.680
Do something !

428
00:59:34.920 --> 00:59:36.640
- I am leaving.
- No, stay!

429
00:59:37.640 --> 00:59:40.400
Oh no, my dear!
That's all me!

430
00:59:40.560 --> 00:59:43.120
I ran into a weirdo!

431
00:59:43.200 --> 00:59:45.600
Don't leave me alone!

432
01:00:38.560 --> 01:00:40.200
What have you discovered, doctor?

433
01:00:41.640 --> 01:00:43.840
Not much, I'm afraid.

434
01:00:44.120 --> 01:00:47.360
I'm glad you're here.

435
01:00:48.040 --> 01:00:51.840
I was going to call someone,
but I would not have liked to pay.

436
01:00:52.120 --> 01:00:54.160
I came on purpose.

437
01:00:54.560 --> 01:00:58.040
I keep thinking about her
since she left my office yesterday.

438
01:00:58.360 --> 01:01:00.560
What is she making?

439
01:01:01.000 --> 01:01:03.520
The Devil alone knows.

440
01:01:04.120 --> 01:01:08.840
I heard her move
objects all night.

441
01:01:09.080 --> 01:01:11.520
It's the first time I hear that.

442
01:01:11.640 --> 01:01:14.160
And this morning she didn't want
let me in.

443
01:01:14.360 --> 01:01:16.480
She is strange.

444
01:01:16.680 --> 01:01:19.320
She absolutely refuses my help.

445
01:01:19.800 --> 01:01:24.360
I don't criticize her.
Something about her baffles me.

446
01:01:24.920 --> 01:01:28.840
I insisted that she call me
when she needs help.

447
01:01:29.840 --> 01:01:31.840
I can't let her stay
in this house.

448
01:01:32.200 --> 01:01:33.680
Don't worry about that.

449
01:01:34.040 --> 01:01:37.840
She wants to leave town
as soon as possible.

450
01:01:38.640 --> 01:01:40.600
I hope she leaves.

451
01:01:43.280 --> 01:01:45.080
I hope she can.

452
01:02:26.520 --> 01:02:28.960
You go ?

453
01:02:29.240 --> 01:02:31.280
Where are you going ?

454
01:02:35.480 --> 01:02:39.400
I won't pay you back
the rest of the week !

455
01:03:36.040 --> 01:03:39.200
It's the gearbox.
Shall we put her on the bridge?

456
01:03:52.480 --> 01:03:54.200
Its good.

457
01:03:55.000 --> 01:03:57.360
- Will it be long?
- Must see.

458
01:03:57.680 --> 01:03:59.640
Want to come down?

459
01:04:00.120 --> 01:04:03.720
- Can I stay here?
- If you want.

460
01:06:26.320 --> 01:06:28.840
when leave
the next bus going east?

461
01:06:30.320 --> 01:06:32.800
I must take it!

462
01:06:49.240 --> 01:06:54.320
I want to get out of here!
I have to go !

463
01:07:08.040 --> 01:07:12.920
The next bus heading
from the east will leave

464
01:07:14.400 --> 01:07:16.000
from gate 9."

465
01:08:20.440 --> 01:08:23.240
Do not close the gate!
Wait !

466
01:08:23.560 --> 01:08:26.200
Let me take this train!

467
01:08:26.520 --> 01:08:30.360
I must leave at any cost,
You're welcome !

468
01:08:35.320 --> 01:08:38.960
Listen to me ! You hear me ?

469
01:08:51.320 --> 01:08:53.640
Why can't I hear anything?

470
01:08:57.960 --> 01:09:00.880
You can help me ?

471
01:09:04.920 --> 01:09:07.360
One moment please !

472
01:09:24.680 --> 01:09:27.920
Why can't anyone hear me?

473
01:10:21.240 --> 01:10:26.360
Doctor, I came to see you
because you are my only hope.

474
01:10:27.560 --> 01:10:32.200
Without your help,
I should go back there.

475
01:10:34.160 --> 01:10:36.520
He tries to attract me
somewhere, to remember.

476
01:10:38.320 --> 01:10:42.720
Tell me what to do, Doctor!

477
01:16:18.680 --> 01:16:20.200
The car is over there.

478
01:16:20.960 --> 01:16:23.400
And the footsteps lead here.

479
01:16:33.800 --> 01:16:35.720
And then, nothing.

480
01:17:01.880 --> 01:17:05.640
It's okay, Will, she's here.

481
01:17:05.960 --> 01:17:07.920
Bring it up!

482
01:17:38.480 --> 01:17:42.400
© Bach Films
